description: Keep the workspace Flash run items in sync with PlatformIO projects.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Flash run configs follow the projects

Each top-level folder with a `platformio.ini` is a project and must have a Flash run item.

When you add, rename, or remove a project, regenerate the configs in the same change:

`python3 tools/sync_flash_configs.py`

Do not edit `.vscode/launch.json` or `.vscode/tasks.json` by hand. `python3 tools/sync_flash_configs.py --check` exits non-zero when those files do not match the project folders.
